            <p>
                The <em>Ui.Vision RPA</em> Enterprise Player has <em>all features of Enterprise Edition</em>, except the ability to create new macros. Technically speaking this means that the record button and the macro edit features (source code tab) are disabled when <em>Ui.Vision RPA</em> XModules are
